<!-- This file defines the server and client component boundary in the App Router. -->

# Server and client

Add `"use client"` only where state, an effect, or an event handler is required.

`src/app/layout.tsx` stays a server component. Browser providers stay in the client `src/app/providers.tsx`.

Do not pull a type, formatter, or pure function into a client module just because the files sit next to each other.

```tsx
// Bad: a display-only file
"use client";
export function Price({ value }: { value: number }) {
  return <span>{value}</span>;
}

// Good: no use client until it has an event
export function Price({ value }: { value: number }) {
  return <span>{value}</span>;
}
```
